  "text": "Inquiries / Materials Request Form | Sompo Holdings Skip to main content Home Japanese Search About Us Group Businesses Investors News & Topics Sustainability careers HOME Inquiries / Materials Requests Inquiries / Materials Request Form Inquiries / Materials Request Form Print Fill in inquiry form Review details and send Complete Terms of Use On occasion, we may respond by telephone instead of e-mailing you. Make sure your contact details are free of errors. We may be unable to respond if the information you enter contains errors. We may take longer to respond around weekends, public holidays, and the year-end/New Year season. We may take longer to respond, or be unable to respond, depending on the content of your inquiry or request. Collection and use of personal information Personal information gathered from you will be used only for the purpose of responding to your inquiry or request and not for any other purpose. Depending on the content, one of our group companies may handle your inquiry or request. In such cases, we may share your information with our group companies and/or receive your information from them. Regarding our processing of your personal information, please refer to the Privacy Policy. Inquiries / Materials Request Form Fill in the form below and click \"Review Details\" if you agree to the above terms of use. Asterisks ( * ) indicate required fields. Why are you contacting us? * Inquiry Materials request Inquiry or request details * 2,000 characters or less. Name * E-mail address * E.g., ××××＠sompo-hd.com Confirm e-mail address Telephone number * E.g. +00 0 0000 0000 Postal code / Zip code * E.g. AB00 1CD Country * Address * E.g., 1-26-1 Nishi-shinjuku, Shinjuku-ku Building name E.g., Sompo Japan Building Company / department E.g., Sompo Holdings Access Ranking Global SOMPO Brand Integrated Annual Reports List of Group Companies Directors and Executive Officers Corporate Profile IR Mail News FAQs Home About Us To Our Stakeholders Cor